Chennai vide proceedings dated 21.08.1999 had revoked the order of removal from service and allowed the disciplinary authority to take final decision after the disposal of the criminal case by the concerned trial Court; that in terms of the aforementioned order of Deputy Inspector General of Police, the petitioner was reinstated into service on 02.12.1999; that the criminal case registered against the petitioner ended in acquittal on the ground of benefit of doubt on 08.04.2005; and that the Deputy Commissioner of Police, Anna Nagar, thereafter by order dated 06.03.2006 awarded the punishment of reduction in time scale of pay by three years with cumulative effect; that in an appeal petition submitted by the petitioner to the 3rd respondent, the punishment was modified into the postponement of one increment without cumulative effect vide his proceedings dated 19.06.2006;
